===Catch Norbert, the suspect{{subst:void|<!--201190404-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Backwater Pass|update|The microfilm used to display projections was stolen. Without this film, the History Exhibit cannot open to the public.<br />You and Pela arrive at the desolate shopping street to chase down Norbert, the suspect.<br />Norbert's words and actions have already revealed the indisputable fact that he is the artifact peddler. Keep going and take him into custody.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''Criminal Accomplice Posing as Silvermane Guard:''' Hey, you two! Don't move!
:'''Pela:''' Must be the accomplice... (Trailblazer), let's think fast!
:'''Criminal Accomplice Posing as Silvermane Guard:''' Say the password or get out of here! This isn't any old shopping street, y'know!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Boil the fish, not the egg.
::'''Criminal Accomplice Posing as Silvermane Guard:''' ...Wh&mdash;What's that supposed to mean? You'd best turn around and go home &mdash; we're busy handling the delivery of&mdash; Ahem! B&mdash;Busy handlin&mdash; um... executing official business. No loitering!
::'''Pela:''' Wait, I remember! Roast the sausage, not the bread. That's the password, right?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Roast the sausage, not the bread.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Help me, Pela...
::'''Pela:''' What? Oh right, the password... Roast the sausage, not the bread. That's the password, right?
:'''Criminal Accomplice Posing as Silvermane Guard:''' Huh? I... Y&mdash;Yes, that's correct...
:'''Pela:''' Mm-hmm! So, you are gonna let us in now? We need to talk to Mr. Norbert about some important business-related matters.
:'''Criminal Accomplice Posing as Silvermane Guard:''' Wait, did you just say... Mr. Norbert?
:'''Criminal Accomplice Posing as Silvermane Guard:''' Who are you guys!? This whole operation the boss hasn't shown his face once. How could a couple of outsiders just walk in knowing his name?
:'''Pela:''' Looks like our cover's blown, (Trailblazer)...
:'''Pela:''' Guess we'll have to do this the hard way!
;(Enter battle)
:{{Список врагов|mode=sent|Silvermane Soldier*1; Silvermane Cannoneer*2; Silvermane Gunner*1}}
:'''Pela:''' We'll probably end up running into more of Norbert's goons up ahead.
:'''Pela:''' We should proceed with caution, (Trailblazer).
{{Dialogue End}}

===Keep going and catch Norbert{{subst:void|<!--201190406-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''Pela:''' Look, it's Norbert again!
:'''Pela:''' Let's see what he's talking about this time.
:'''Norbert:''' ...And the film? Is it packed and ready to go?
:'''Attendant Posing as Silvermane Guard:''' Right here, boss! The buyer is arriving soon. Here, this way!
:'''Norbert:''' Very good, very good. Well done. Patience, soon we will all be rich.
----
:'''Pela:''' Film! Did you hear that? That film he mentioned must be the same one that was stolen from the museum.
:'''Pela:''' Why would someone from such a wealthy family do something like this for money... It's unbelievable! We have to find a way to stop this before they sell the film!
----
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Pela:''' (Trailblazer), wait, don't make a move yet!
:'''Pela:''' We should take some pictures as evidence in case the culprit denies the charges.
:'''Pela:''' Your equipment probably has better specs than mine &mdash; I'll leave the picture-taking to you.

;(Talk to Norbert)
:'''Norbert:''' *whimper* ...Mr. Cold Feet, what should I do in a situation like this? Save me, save me!
:'''Pela:''' What are you talking about? Who's got cold feet?
:'''Norbert:''' Ah... N&mdash;Nothing, I was just talking to myself....
:'''Norbert:''' I had my whole life ahead of me... is it all over? *whimper*
:'''Pela:''' Enough blubbing. If you didn't want to face the time, why do the crime? Everyone is responsible for the decisions they make in life &mdash; no exceptions.

;(Talk to Greedy Buyer)
:'''Greedy Buyer:''' Curse it, curse it all! He warned me not to carry out the transaction in person, but I didn't want to spend money on hiring a bagman...
:'''Greedy Buyer:''' I don't want to go to prison! Not even for a day!
:'''Pela:''' Hmph, if you think you can commit crimes and go unpunished, dream on!

;(Talk to Pela)
:'''Pela:''' It was a difficult journey, (Trailblazer), but it had a happy ending! Not only did we manage to recover the microfilm, but we also caught the culprit behind the museum thefts... That's something worth celebrating.
:'''Pela:''' However, I'm still a little confused... Mr. Norbert is wealthy and opportunistic, but how did he manage to find so many accomplices and organize such a large-scale smuggling operation...
:'''Pela:''' ...These questions can wait until the interrogation. As for you and me, our work ends here. Thanks for your efforts, (Trailblazer).
:'''Pela:''' Come on, let's take the microfilm back to the museum.
{{Dialogue End}}

